<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="TVM5.9.5">
<l>naṉṉalat tōḻimīrkāḷ nallavantaṇar vēḷvippukai</l>
<l>mainnalaṅ koṇṭuyarviṇ maṟaikkuntaṇ ṭiruvallavāḻ</l>
<l>kaṉṉalaṅ kaṭṭitaṉṉaik kaṉiyaiyiṉ ṉamutantaṉṉai</l>
<l>yeṉṉalaṅ koḷcuṭarai yeṉṟukolkaṇkaḷ kāṇpatuvē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>O friends with good beauty,</l>
<l>when will [my] eyes see the glow that takes my beauty,</l>
<l>the potted jaggery, the ripe fruit, the sweet ambrosia</l>
<l>from cool Tiruvallavāḻ, where the smoke from the sacrifice of good brahmins</l>
	<l>hides the high sky with the goodness of black [clouds]?</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
